# Sign out one device. Start the API with Aspire first.
@host = http://localhost:5279
@refreshToken = paste-a-refresh-token

### Any token → 204. An unknown one too: either way, it no longer works.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/sessions/revoke
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### No token → 400, the errors name the field.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/sessions/revoke
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": ""
}
